    <pubDate>Wed, 28 Aug 2024 02:34:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>漫谈汽车科技是公众号Vehicle（微信：VehicleEngineering）新设的播客节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们将通过声音的方式，与大家一起分享有趣的汽车科技。</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 话题简介 |</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目主播之一Roger很荣幸请到了一位在Bilibili平台做租车相关视频内容的up主</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/24557232" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/24557232"><span>豌豆黄Autopea</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>| 时间轴 |</span></p><span></span><h3><span>租车行业：从汽车科技到租赁测评</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11">00:11</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><span>租车平台对比：一嗨租车和神州租车</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><span>租车测评的起源：解决用户痛点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="197">03:17</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><span>租车测评的重点：车型配置和性价比</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="269">04:29</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><span>租车平台的车型配置偏好</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="323">05:23</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><span>特斯拉</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Yi421a75B/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Yi421a75B/"><span> Model Y </span></a><span>和 Model 3 租车体验</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="395">06:35</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hT421a76Y" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hT421a76Y"><span>租车提车前的注意事项</span></a><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="644">10:44</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><span>租车年龄限制和认证流程</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><span>租车安全驾驶建议</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="937">15:37</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><span>汽车行业变革与自动驾驶技术</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1119">18:39</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><span>特斯拉自动驾驶系统的优缺点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1467">24:27</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><span>租车安全事故的应对措施</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><span>自驾游的乐趣与安全</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1864">31:04</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><span>自驾游的独特体验：拥抱自由与寂静</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2081">34:41</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><span>自驾游的温暖回忆：好心人的帮助</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2188">36:28</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><span>租车和自驾的个人经历分享</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2324">38:44</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><span>城市交通拥堵与租车成本</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2503">41:43</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><span>内容创作的收获与未来计划</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2579">42:59</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><span>内容创作的激励与收益</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2715">45:15</a></span></h3><span></span><h3><span>播客和视频频道合作展望</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2961">49:21</a></span></h3>]]></description>
